    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3572ab09d2a8362a61bc0dd6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈，太好了！\n我现在也是一样的感觉。看来今天能睡得很熟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c106f27ef5aa1682b5b1f58a0e8736f68534eeaaf8ae62f3641232b5e348b361",
