      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:453c306b611e3081d3ecb1c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个突如其来的邀约让我愣住了。\n于是我开始思考要怎么做。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ece1135bce77b7a6ffd1bf39e46917c8d7766a5deff7835a533eada532d463e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e8fc53561477b33f147b718",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "幸好──我接下来没有事情要做。\n我下定决心后，便急忙收拾行李，\n决定去追她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c73a8f76949b5f9dcb6cc993e1f17a5280595dc934187eed8ca137811ae1104d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1057/storytimeline_501057112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
